    dialog:
    - We're done
    - Miss Anayo! Miss Anayo! MISS ANAYO!
    - ' I''m here! Stop your screeching, you''re scaring the animals!'
    - ' Oops! Sorry...'
    - We're done cleaning up the mess!
    - ...
    - ' You''ve uphelp your end of the bargain.'
    - Here.
    - Flowers?
    - ' A trick has been placed on the forest....'
    - 'Without my flowers, you''ll end up wandering around in circles unable to escape. '
    - Then.. thank you
    - I was only upholding my part in the bargain.
    - ... Good luck
